; Undecorated stdcall export alias for 32-bit Windows builds with zig.
; zig's built-in COFF linker has no --kill-at, so the engine entry point
; would otherwise be exported as GiveFnptrsToDll@8 and HLDS/Metamod
; (GetProcAddress("GiveFnptrsToDll")) would fail to find it.
; Mirrors the MSVC /EXPORT pragma in src/linkage.cpp.
EXPORTS
	GiveFnptrsToDll=GiveFnptrsToDll@8 @1
